      "writtenOn": "2022-03-04T01:00:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not sufficient to only enable `connectable` on disconnect since you also want to be connectable when the stack starts.\n\nYou may want to add a new function with the following logic and run it here and on property update (i\u0027ve marked it with a comment):\n\n```\n\nlet has_unconnected \u003d false;\nfor device in self.bonded_devices {\n  if !device.connected {\n    has_unconnected \u003d true;\n  }\n}\n\nif has_unconnected {\n  self.set_connectable(true);\n} else {\n  self.set_connectable(false);\n}\n\n\n```\n\n@sonnysasaka Looks good?",
      "revId": "0cd9a33ae72e168c1dc8151e610dc96f552ddca5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
